'''PAC-MAN Fever''' (パックマンフィーバー, ''Pakkuman Fībā'', '''Pac-Man Fever''') is a 1-slot [[Cat Combo]]. It was added in [[Version 15.5 Update|Version 15.5]].

==Effect==
"Resistant" Effect UP (Sm): The effect of this ability is increased by 10%.

